          "detailed_content": "![](https://cdn.staging.oregon.platform-os.com/instances/11587/property_uploads/modules/insites_assets/assets_upload/asset/62357af5-920a-41a1-aa31-803d8f785a7f/blog-img-1.webp?updated=1725522346)\n\n#### Document applied updates and their impact:\n\n* Maintain a log of all security updates applied to the intranet.\n* Record the date, version number, and any known issues or changes associated with the update.\n* Track the impact of updates on the intranet's performance and user experience.\n\n#### Dependencies:\n* Intranet platform updates\n* Security software updates\n* Network infrastructure updates\n\n#### Resources:\n* IT Administrator\n* Security Specialist\n* Intranet Administrator\n* Network Engineer\n\n#### Milestones:\n* Quarterly security updates applied\n* Annual security audit conducted\n* Zero-day vulnerabilities addressed within [timeframe]\n* Intranet platform maintained at latest supported version\n\nBy following these subtasks and addressing the dependencies, you can ensure that your intranet is protected against security threats and remains up-to-date with the latest security best practices.",
          "timeline_content": "#### Monitor for new security vulnerabilities and patches:\n* Subscribe to security advisories from the intranet platform vendor and other relevant sources.\n* Use vulnerability scanning tools to identify potential security risks.\n* Stay informed about emerging security threats and trends.\n\n#### Schedule and apply security updates:\n* Create a schedule for regular security updates, taking into account the frequency of updates from the intranet platform vendor.\n* Prioritize critical updates and apply them immediately.\n* Test updates in a staging environment before applying them to the production environment.\n\n#### Test the intranet after updates to ensure it functions correctly:\n* Conduct thorough testing to verify that the intranet's functionality remains intact after updates.\n* Pay attention to any errors or unexpected behavior.\n* Document the testing process and results.\n \n![](https://cdn.staging.oregon.platform-os.com/instances/11587/property_uploads/modules/insites_assets/assets_upload/asset/dbb78995-6b4e-446a-9588-3bb011b1e0b4/timeline-img.webp?updated=1725522218http://)",
